		(property "Description" "WCH CH32H417 dual-core RISC-V (V5F 400MHz + V3F 150MHz), 960KB flash, 896KB SRAM, USB3.2 Gen1/USBHS/USBFS-OTG, USB PD, Ethernet MAC+PHY, SerDes, 2x12b 5Msps ADC, 10b 20Msps HSADC, 2x DAC, 3x OPA, QFN88. Every AF mux is a pin alternate (select per pin: right-click > Alternate pin function). ADC_INx is shared by ADC1 and ADC2."
